### 7. Generar URL Firmada para AWS S3
POST http://localhost:3000/api/documents/presigned-url
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwiZW1haWwiOiJhZG1pbkBlbnRlcnByaXNlLmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJBZG1pbiIsImlhdCI6MTc5MTczNTg0NSwiZXhwIjoxNzkxNzY0NjQ1fQ.GTrOKIKBU4HjilgNdFmHH1iKgfKHgTw54x5a2zQeWLI
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fileName": "manual-seguridad-2026.pdf",
    "fileType": "application/pdf"
}

### 7.5. Subir el PDF real a S3 usando la URL Firmada
PUT https://enterprise-ai-docs-storage-2026.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/documents/1791740861870-manual-seguridad-2026.pdf?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Credential=AKIAQT3BPO7EGZXAVXFQ%2F20261011%2Fus-east-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20261011T174741Z&X-Amz-Expires=300&X-Amz-Signature=ca98a4d7e9b2bb84438da8685f18ce181e2e9569c01e50b763ba0704941bca36&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&x-amz-checksum-crc32=AAAAAA%3D%3D&x-amz-sdk-checksum-algorithm=CRC32&x-id=PutObject

< ./manual-seguridad-2026.pdf


